# CodiPadNode attribution and notices

Original CodiPad code in `native/CodiPadNode` is licensed under GPL-3.0-only in
the root `LICENSE` file. Third-party runtime components retain their original
licenses and notices, described below.

## 1. Upstream Node.js runtime

The linked runtime is Node.js 24.21.0 built from the nodejs.org distribution
tarball (pinned in `build/runtime-manifest.json`). Its license is Node.js's
`LICENSE` (MIT plus bundled third-party notices), preserved in
`patches/node/NODE-LICENSE` and staged alongside the runtime bundle.

## 2. a-shell node-port patches

The iOS Node build uses five patches derived from the a-shell node port:

- `patches/node/gyp-ios.patch`, `platform.patch`, `public-vm.patch`,
  `runtime.patch`, and `v8-alias-writes.patch`.
- Provenance: `https://github.com/holzschu/a-shell`, commit
  `79aac66fe8a21a626d7fdd6ee42d24039a21802b`, path `node`.
- License: BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2019, Nicolas Holzschuch
  (`patches/node/A-SHELL-LICENSE.txt`).

`patches/node/process-authority.patch`, `session-environment.patch`, and
`stdio-ipc.patch` are original CodiPad patches under GPL-3.0-only.

## Runtime ABI contract

`PageAllocator.cpp` exports `codipad_v8_rx_begin`, `codipad_v8_rx_end`, and
`codipad_v8_rw_begin`. `v8-alias-writes.patch` routes V8 code writes through
`codipad_v8_rw_begin + (address - codipad_v8_rx_begin)`.
